%% Figure 13-1 — Context Manifest Assembly
%% Retail records A and B pass source and consumer checks and enter context. The incorrectly tagged insurance result fails the source check and follows a quarantine path that cannot deliver its payload to the agent.
flowchart LR
 A["Retail product registry"] -->|indexes A| I["Retrieval index"]
 B["Retail CRM"] -->|indexes B| I
 X["Insurance policy repository"] -->|indexes item| I
 I -->|returns hits| S["Context retrieval service"]
 S -->|checks sources| C["Source ACL recheck"]
 C -->|admits A/B| M["Context assembler / consumer recheck"]
 C -.->|rejects insurance| Q["Restricted quarantine"]
 M -->|records decisions| R[("Context Manifest")]
 Q -.->|records denial| R
 M -->|delivers A/B| U["Context consumer"]
